            "description_html": "<b>Modern Glass Mounted Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe satin nickel finished glass mount hook is a great way to add modern style and functionality to your glass shower enclosure. Hang a few in the bathroom to hold towels and robes. This Modern Hook comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware for 3/16\" to 1/2\" Thick Glass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SD-HOOK-size.gif?v=1704354747\" width=\"580\" height=\"220\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-SD-HOOK-US15 Glass Wall Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-SD-HOOK-US15 Glass Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass and 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Height: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Mount Base Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Mount Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Thickness: 3/16\" to 1/2\" Thick Glass.</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 3/8\" Hole Diameter.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
